<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>VanVleet earns <strong>$25m</strong> in 2026-27, third on the <a href="/teams/houston-rockets/">Houston</a> payroll and the last year of his contract. He was paid <strong>$42.85m</strong> in 2024-25.</p>
<p>His career earnings reach <strong>$215.68m</strong> across eleven seasons. The salary is <strong>12.47%</strong> of Houston’s <strong>$200.41m</strong> payroll.</p>

