<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
How Much Is Fred VanVleet’s Contract Worth at Houston?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>VanVleet signed a two-year contract worth <strong>$50m</strong> on July 6, 2025 under Early Bird rights, fully guaranteed, with a player option on this season that he exercised on June 29, 2026.</p>
<p>It replaced a maximum contract that had paid him <strong>$42.85m</strong>, so the new deal cut his pay by <strong>$17.85m</strong> a year. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2027 at 33.</p>

