</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Published estimates put VanVleet’s net worth at around <strong>$20m</strong>, against <strong>$215.68m</strong> in career earnings. That figure reads as a stale one given how much of the money arrived after 2020.</p>
<p>He went undrafted out of Wichita State in 2016 and his first NBA season paid <strong>$543k</strong>. He has since won a championship and been paid more than any other undrafted player in league history.</p>

