<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/fred-vanvleet/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/fred-vanvleet/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Fred VanVleet’s Salary at Houston?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"VanVleet earns $25m in 2026-27, third on the Houston payroll and the last year of his contract. He was paid $42.85m in 2024-25. His career earnings reach $215.68m across eleven seasons. The salary is 12.47% of Houston’s $200.41m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Fred VanVleet Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The contract expires at the end of this season and he becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2027 at 33. A point guard of his age and size usually signs shorter deals from that point, and Houston holds his Bird rights if it wants to keep him."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Fred VanVleet Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $25m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Fred VanVleet’s Contract Worth at Houston?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"VanVleet signed a two-year contract worth $50m on July 6, 2025 under Early Bird rights, fully guaranteed, with a player option on this season that he exercised on June 29, 2026. It replaced a maximum contract that had paid him $42.85m, so the new deal cut his pay by $17.85m a year. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2027 at 33."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Fred VanVleet’s Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Published estimates put VanVleet’s net worth at around $20m, against $215.68m in career earnings. That figure reads as a stale one given how much of the money arrived after 2020. He went undrafted out of Wichita State in 2016 and his first NBA season paid $543k. He has since won a championship and been paid more than any other undrafted player in league history."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Fred VanVleet on $25m in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"VanVleet is paid $25m because he runs an offense and defends the ball, and because he agreed to a smaller figure to stay at Houston. He has earned more than any undrafted player in the history of the league."}}]}</script>
